  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/700/arsenal_full_1000-png.png\" alt=\"军械库\"></p>\n<h2>🗡️ 来自往昔的传奇武器——非亲手锻造，而是靠征服赢取。</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模组加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-Spell_Engine-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Spell Engine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 探索更多 RPG 系列内容</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"法师\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盗贼\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠宝\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>📦 安装</h1>\n<h3>必需</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a> &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>🗡️ 特性</h1>\n<h2>40+ 件史诗级武器，涵盖 15 种不同类型</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每件武器至少内置一个被动法术</li>\n<li>美术风格致敬《Minecraft Dungeons》</li>\n<li>内容灵感源自经典《魔兽世界》</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/731/sword-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/728/hammer-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/727/damage_staff-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/730/shield-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/726/bow-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/729/healing_staff-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/866/fight_1-png.png\" alt=\"光辉\"></p>\n<h2>20+ 个被动法术</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>机制灵感来源于《Minecraft Dungeons》（部分为完美复刻：漩涡、冲击波、光辉……）</li>\n<li>适用于所有武器类型的法术（近战法术、弓术法术、魔法伤害法术……）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/832/apol_gimped-png.png\" alt=\"替代文本\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/835/staff_gimped-png.png\" alt=\"替代文本\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/833/crossbow_gimped-png.png\" alt=\"替代文本\"></p>\n<h2>仅作为战利品获取</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>由 Boss 掉落（末影龙、凋灵、监守者以及第三方模组 Boss）</li>\n<li>包含在终局地牢宝箱中（例如末地城宝箱）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>战利品表注入可在 <code>config/rpg_series/loot_items.json</code> 中进行配置。军械库武器列于 5 级武器标签下。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/834/dragon_drop-png.png\" alt=\"替代文本\"></p>\n<h1>专为多人游戏设计</h1>\n<p>创建你自己的 RPG 服务器。使用我们的优惠码可享更低价格，同时支持我们。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p>\n<h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1>\n<p>探索众多由我们亲爱的合作伙伴制作的 Spell Engine 模组！</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"无政府\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素法师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"力量大师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
